        "title": "AlphaESS VitaPower",
        "description": "Enter the address of the VitaPower. Modbus TCP only answers on the LAN port, not over Wi-Fi. The battery accepts a single Modbus client: remove any other Modbus connection to it (such as a YAML `modbus:` hub) first.",
